{"seq":1,"slug":"gpsr-general-safety-requirement","title":"GPSR 一般安全要求与适用范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/product-safety-baseline/gpsr-general-safety-requirement","wordCount":1743,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpsr-一般安全要求与适用范围\">GPSR 一般安全要求与适用范围</h1><p>欧盟《通用产品安全条例》Regulation (EU) 2023/988（简称 GPSR）自 <strong>2024 年 12 月 13 日</strong>起适用，取代实施了二十年的《通用产品安全指令》2001/95/EC。它带来的最大结构变化是：消费者保护从&quot;事后处置危险品&quot;前移为&quot;上市前必须证明安全&quot;。一件商品要在欧盟境内投放，不再只是贴着 CE 就能过关——经营者必须能拿出一份能自证的安全评估，并让它在监管问询时随时可取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-符合标准-到-自证安全\">核心概念：从&quot;符合标准&quot;到&quot;自证安全&quot;</h2><p>旧指令时代，合规的通行做法是&quot;命中一条协调标准即视为安全&quot;。GPSR 改变了两件事：一是把一般安全要求上升为对所有消费品的强制义务，二是把举证责任前移到经营者内部的<strong>风险评估</strong>。协调标准仍然有用，但它只是安全的一种证据形式，不再是可以替代评估的充分条件。因此在系统层面，产品主数据里必须多出一个&quot;安全档案&quot;实体，与 SKU 一一对应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商品拟投放欧盟市场] --&gt; B{是否属于消费用途?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[排除 GPSR 适用]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{是否在排除清单?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| C&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[识别可能危害]&#10;  E --&gt; F[评估风险等级]&#10;  F --&gt; G{低于可接受阈值?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[记录技术文档 + 可追溯标识]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[设计缓解措施并复评]&#10;  I --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; J[投放市场并留档待查]\">graph TD\n  A[商品拟投放欧盟市场] --&gt; B{是否属于消费用途?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[排除 GPSR 适用]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{是否在排除清单?}\n  D --&gt;|是| C\n  D --&gt;|否| E[识别可能危害]\n  E --&gt; F[评估风险等级]\n  F --&gt; G{低于可接受阈值?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[记录技术文档 + 可追溯标识]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[设计缓解措施并复评]\n  I --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; J[投放市场并留档待查]</pre><h2 id=\"适用范围与排除清单\">适用范围与排除清单</h2><p>判断某件商品是否落入 GPSR，先看用途、再看清单。这一点在跨境场景下尤其重要：同一批货可能因为销售渠道或用途描述不同，而适用完全不同的义务组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>落入 GPSR</th>\n<th>排除在 GPSR 之外</th>\n<th>排除原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产品用途</td>\n<td>消费品（含供消费者使用的非消费类产品）</td>\n<td>食品、饲料</td>\n<td>另有食品安全法规体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品用途</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>药品、医疗器械</td>\n<td>另有药品与器械审评体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品用途</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>机动车及其部件</td>\n<td>另有型式认证体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销售渠道</td>\n<td>线下零售、线上销售均在范围内</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>线上销售同样受约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>制造商、进口商、分销商、授权代表、履约服务商、线上市场</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>经济经营者全覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地域</td>\n<td>在欧盟境内投放或提供</td>\n<td>仅在第三国流通</td>\n<td>无欧盟市场存在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要特别提醒的是&quot;线上销售&quot;这一行。GPSR 明确把<strong>远程销售</strong>与<strong>线上市场</strong>纳入范围：线上报价本身就要展示制造商或欧盟责任主体的信息、足以识别产品的图像以及相关警示与安全信息；线上市场服务提供者则需要向 Safety Gate 登记、指定单一联络点，并配合下架不安全商品。这与线下货架的信息义务在实质上是同一套要求，只是承载介质的差别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全评估的五个维度\">安全评估的五个维度</h2><p>GPSR 要求的安全评估不是一次性的过审动作，而是一份可以被复审的记录。实践中可以拆成五个可落库的维度，每个维度都要有可追溯的依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危害识别\">危害识别</h3><p>先穷举&quot;这件商品可能怎样伤人&quot;，而不是先看竞品怎么做。危害识别的输入应包含设计图纸、材料清单、既有客诉与退货原因、同类产品的公开召回记录。对跨境卖家而言，公开召回记录是最廉价也最容易被忽略的情报源：同类目在 Safety Gate 上被通报的产品，通常已经暴露了该品类的典型失效模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"风险判定\">风险判定</h3><p>把每个危害映射到&quot;严重程度 × 发生可能性&quot;，得到风险等级。这一步的判定标准必须写进文档，否则不同批次、不同审核人之间的结论无法比较。具体的分级方法与矩阵构造在 <a href=\"../safety-signal-incident-report/safety-risk-hazard-assessment\">安全风险评估与危害分级</a> 中展开，这里只强调一个约束：判定标准要与证据分开存储，标准可版本化，证据只追加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓解措施与余留风险\">缓解措施与余留风险</h3><p>缓解措施落定后必须重算一次风险，记录&quot;采取措施后的余留风险&quot;是否可接受。这一步是监管问询中最常见的缺口——许多档案只有原始风险等级，没有复评后的结论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;product_ref&quot;: &quot;GTIN-13:0123456789012&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assessment_version&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;assessed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot;,&#10;  &quot;standard_basis&quot;: [&quot;EN 71-1&quot;, &quot;EN 62115&quot;],&#10;  &quot;hazards&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;hazard_id&quot;: &quot;H-EDGE-01&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;mechanical_sharp_edge&quot;,&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: 3,&#10;      &quot;likelihood&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;risk_before&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;,&#10;      &quot;mitigation&quot;: &quot;edge_radius_spec_0.5mm&quot;,&#10;      &quot;risk_after&quot;: &quot;low&quot;,&#10;      &quot;evidence_ref&quot;: &quot;test-report/2026-08/TR-8841.pdf&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;residual_risk_verdict&quot;: &quot;acceptable&quot;,&#10;  &quot;responsible_person_ref&quot;: &quot;RP-EU-00417&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"product_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GTIN-13:0123456789012\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assessment_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assessed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"standard_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EN 71-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EN 62115\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hazards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hazard_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"H-EDGE-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mechanical_sharp_edge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"likelihood\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"risk_before\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mitigation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"edge_radius_spec_0.5mm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"risk_after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test-report/2026-08/TR-8841.pdf\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"residual_risk_verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acceptable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"responsible_person_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RP-EU-00417\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"文档留存与更新触发\">文档留存与更新触发</h3><p>技术文档不是一次性产物。设计变更、材料替换、新的伤害信号、监管标准更新，都应当触发档案升版。系统上把&quot;档案版本&quot;与&quot;变更事件&quot;关联起来，比在文件名里加日期可靠得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与相邻法规的边界\">与相邻法规的边界</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法规</th>\n<th>与 GPSR 的关系</th>\n<th>实操影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPSD 2001/95/EC</td>\n<td>被 GPSR 取代</td>\n<td>2024-12-13 前投放且合规的存量商品可继续流通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Regulation (EU) 2019/1020</td>\n<td>市场监管框架，与 GPSR 互补</td>\n<td>责任主体与市场监管权限由其界定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品责任指令 (EU) 2024/2853</td>\n<td>侵权责任侧</td>\n<td>适用于 2026-12-08 之后投放的产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特定品类安全法规（玩具、化妆品等）</td>\n<td>特别法优先</td>\n<td>品类法规已覆盖的安全事项不再重复适用一般安全要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的逻辑值得记住：GPSR 是&quot;兜底&quot;，而不是&quot;叠加&quot;。当品类专项法规已经就某个安全事项作出规定时，该事项由专项法规管辖；GPSR 只在专项法规留下空白的地方起作用。这一原则直接决定了合规系统的设计——安全要求应当是&quot;按品类可插拔的规则集&quot;，而不是一张全品类通用的大表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规证据链的落库设计\">合规证据链的落库设计</h2><p>安全合规的工程化落点，是把上述义务变成几张可查询、可按 SKU 追溯的表。核心是三张：产品安全档案、证据引用、责任主体绑定。下面给出一个最小可用的骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table product_safety_file (&#10;  id                bigserial primary key,&#10;  gtin              text        not null,&#10;  assessment_version int        not null,&#10;  risk_verdict      text        not null check (risk_verdict in (&#39;acceptable&#39;,&#39;unacceptable&#39;)),&#10;  responsible_person_id bigint  not null,&#10;  effective_from    date        not null,&#10;  superseded_at     date,&#10;  unique (gtin, assessment_version)&#10;);&#10;&#10;create table safety_evidence (&#10;  id                bigserial primary key,&#10;  safety_file_id    bigint      not null references product_safety_file(id),&#10;  evidence_type     text        not null,  -- test_report | standard_decl | complaint_analysis&#10;  uri               text        not null,&#10;  issued_at         date        not null,&#10;  created_at        timestamptz not null default now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 监管问询时最常用的查询：某 GTIN 当前生效的档案与全部证据&#10;select f.gtin, f.assessment_version, f.risk_verdict, e.evidence_type, e.uri&#10;from product_safety_file f&#10;join safety_evidence e on e.safety_file_id = f.id&#10;where f.gtin = $1 and f.superseded_at is null&#10;order by e.issued_at desc;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product_safety_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessment_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  risk_verdict      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (risk_verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'acceptable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unacceptable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  responsible_person_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  superseded_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gtin, assessment_version)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safety_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  safety_file_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_safety_file(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- test_report | standard_decl | complaint_analysis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uri               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 监管问询时最常用的查询：某 GTIN 当前生效的档案与全部证据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessment_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">risk_verdict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uri</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_safety_file f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_evidence e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">safety_file_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">superseded_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">issued_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>superseded_at</code> 而不是 <code>is_current</code> 作为状态字段，是为了保留完整的版本历史——召回调查经常需要回看&quot;当时那一版评估是怎么写的&quot;，这在事后追溯中是决定性的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GPSR 自 2024-12-13 适用，取代指令 2001/95/EC；存量合规商品可继续流通。</li>\n<li>一般安全要求是兜底义务；品类专项法规优先，GPSR 填补空白。</li>\n<li>线上销售与线上市场被明确纳入范围，信息义务与线下同源。</li>\n<li>安全评估的产物是可复审、可追溯的档案，不是一次性过审材料。</li>\n<li>合规落地的最小结构是&quot;安全档案 + 证据引用 + 责任主体绑定&quot;三张表。</li>\n<li>责任主体如何指定、履约服务商承担什么，见 <a href=\"responsible-person-fsp-obligation\">欧盟责任人/UKRP/履约服务商义务</a>。</li>\n<li>档案中的可追溯标识与标签规范，见 <a href=\"technical-doc-traceability-label\">技术文档、可追溯标签与合规标识</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation — Wikipedia</a>（适用日期 2024-12-13、取代 GPSD、线上市场向 Safety Gate 登记）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/business/product-rules-compliance/product-safety-and-liability/selling-products-safely/index_en.htm\">Selling products safely in the EU — Your Europe</a>（线上市场与卖家同受约束、Safety Business Gateway 报告）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Product_Liability_Directive\">Product Liability Directive — Wikipedia</a>（指令 (EU) 2024/2853 适用于 2026-12-08 后投放的产品）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPSR 一般安全要求与适用范围","id":"gpsr-一般安全要求与适用范围"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从\"符合标准\"到\"自证安全\"","id":"核心概念-从-符合标准-到-自证安全"},{"level":2,"text":"适用范围与排除清单","id":"适用范围与排除清单"},{"level":2,"text":"安全评估的五个维度","id":"安全评估的五个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"危害识别","id":"危害识别"},{"level":3,"text":"风险判定","id":"风险判定"},{"level":3,"text":"缓解措施与余留风险","id":"缓解措施与余留风险"},{"level":3,"text":"文档留存与更新触发","id":"文档留存与更新触发"},{"level":3,"text":"与相邻法规的边界","id":"与相邻法规的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"合规证据链的落库设计","id":"合规证据链的落库设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"欧盟责任人/UKRP/履约服务商义务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/product-safety-baseline/responsible-person-fsp-obligation"}}